                With search engine optimization (SEO) becoming more competitive, understanding keyword density, total word count, and reading level is critical for content performance. Google and other search engines favor content that is structured, readable, and relevant to user queries. Using a Word Counter ensures that your content meets these requirements by highlighting the most-used words, showing reading complexity, and allowing you to adjust the text in real time.
            </p>

